   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "His book sold over seven hundred thousand copies and became a bestseller.",
   "cap": "His book sold over|700,000 copies|and became a bestseller.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "So the casinos fought back. They added more decks and shuffled far more often.",
   "cap": "So the casinos fought back.|They added more decks|and shuffled far more often.",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Thorp was asked to leave casinos, so he tried disguises like false beards.",
